 by the traffic data, not by a time saving.\n\nThe 4.50 SGD contested is below POL-GEN-22's 10.00 SGD band in which the AI ruling is final, no fraud flag applies, POL-RD-25's 2 km limb is not in force, and no route-deviation clause produces a referral. Confidence 0.85, above POL-RD-25's 0.80 bar."
